    "['ais interval [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management maintenance-domain md1 maintenance-association ma1 ais interval 60', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]', 'unit [parameter2] family [parameter3] storm-control [parameter4]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for `ais interval 60`:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management maintenance-domain md1 maintenance-association ma1 ais interval 60\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper, AIS (Alarm Indication Signal) configuration is part of the Ethernet OAM CFM (Connectivity Fault Management) hierarchy. The interval is specified in seconds (60 in this case), matching the Huawei configuration.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols oam ethernet connectivity-fault-management maintenance-domain md1 maintenance-association ma1 ais interval 60'}]]": 1,
